  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>entry</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2520</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000047</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここなら、しばらく休めるな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Este parece um bom lugar
para descansar.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2607</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000048</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よっしゃ！
じゃあ、出発すっか!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Beleza! Vamos nessa!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2654</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000049</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あんた、妙に楽しそうね。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Você anda estranhamente alegre.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900004a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ん？　何か言ったか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hã? Você disse alguma coisa?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2722</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900004b</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>さあ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm, será que disse?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2824</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900004c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>具合でも悪いのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Está se sentindo mal?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2859</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900004d</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……いえ、何でもありません。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Não, estou bem.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2896</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900004e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、顔色が悪いみたいだよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sério? Não tá com boa cara.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2924</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900004f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……本当に何でもないから。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Na verdade, me sinto bem.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2978</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000050</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>本当に大丈夫か？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tem certeza de que está bem?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000051</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……先を急ぎましょう。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Precisamos ir andando.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3027</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000052</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3064</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000053</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>無理はするなよ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não se force.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3092</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000054</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はい。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não vou me forçar.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s0-0</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヒューマの行商人なら
カレーズを見て回るって
言ってたよ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Os mercadores Huma disseram que
gostam de montar banca em Karez.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Literally, "tour Karez" but if it fits.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s0-1</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2228</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おう。また会ったな。
仕事で初めてこっちに
きたんだけどよ、</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>E aí, a gente se encontra de novo.
Comecei a vender coisas aqui.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2250</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カレーズってのは、
すごいもんだな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Karez é um lugar bem legal.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2272</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんか歴史を感じるって
いうか……こんな場所で
歴史小説が読めれば最高だな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tem história no ar aqui... Ler um
romance histórico num lugar assim
seria a cereja do bolo.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひょっとして、歴史小説
貸してくれたりしねぇ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Se você tiver um, será que
me empresta?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2003</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;Sim
Não</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Green&gt;『歴史小説』を貸し出しました。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Green&gt;Emprestou o Historical Novel.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>The one you get back at the gym.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2078</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱりなぁー。
持ってるような気がしたんだよ。
んじゃ、しばらく借りるぜ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eu sabia que você tinha um!
Dava pra sentir. Enfim, valeu.
Vou ficar com ele um tempinho.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>The Yes response.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2113</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだ……
当てがはずれちまったな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acho que não tem.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>I believe this is the No response.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2163</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>実は、まだ読み終わってないんだ。
悪いけど、また来てくれよな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A verdade é que quero continuar
lendo. Me procura depois, tá?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うーむ……
カレーズってのは、
すごいもんだな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>É, Karez é demais mesmo.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s0-2</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>946</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ミリッツァ……!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Militsa, é você?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1026</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今は戦うつもりはない……
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Não tenho intenção de lutar
com você neste momento.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1078</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Yellow&gt;聖獣&lt;White&gt;を探しているそうだな、
&lt;Hilda&gt;……
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Você está atrás das
&lt;Yellow&gt;Bestas Sagradas&lt;White&gt;,
não está, &lt;Hilda&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Yellow&gt;純粋なヒトの身体&lt;White&gt;を
手に入れるためか……？
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tudo pra receber o tal
&lt;Yellow&gt;corpo puro&lt;White&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>I am trying to add an extra layer of disdain.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1122</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1144</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ハーフの身体がそんなに嫌か？
&lt;Yellow&gt;純粋なヒトの身体&lt;White&gt;は、そんなに
すばらしいものなのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Você odeia tanto ser Half?
O corpo de um &lt;Yellow&gt;humano puro&lt;White&gt;
é mesmo tão maravilhoso?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1166</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヒューマとガジュマが
&lt;Yellow&gt;同じヒト&lt;White&gt;だというのなら、
その間に生まれた私たちは
&lt;Cyan&gt;純粋&lt;White&gt;ではないのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mas se Huma e Gajuma são da
&lt;Yellow&gt;mesma raça humana&lt;White&gt;,
quem é misto não seria
&lt;Cyan&gt;puro&lt;White&gt; também?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1213</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isso é...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1235</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……おまえたちが&lt;Yellow&gt;聖獣の力&lt;White&gt;を
手に入れ、どんな事をしようと、
この世界は変わりはしない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mesmo que você use o poder das
&lt;Yellow&gt;Bestas Sagradas&lt;White&gt;, o mundo
não vai mudar...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1272</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……私にとってはな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Pelo menos, não pra mim...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……おまえたちの取り戻そうと
している&lt;Yellow&gt;共存社会&lt;White&gt;ですら、
差別されて来たハーフにはな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Porque fui discriminada por ser
Half na &lt;Yellow&gt;sociedade de
coexistência&lt;White&gt; que você quer
trazer de volta.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>So, even if hate between Gajuma and Hma dissipates, bigotry against the Halfs remains regardless.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1413</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Hilda&gt;……&lt;Blue&gt;王の盾&lt;White&gt;に戻れ。
私たちの居場所は……
&lt;Blue&gt;王の盾&lt;White&gt;以外にはない。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...&lt;Hilda&gt;... Volte para o
&lt;Blue&gt;Escudo Real&lt;White&gt;. Não existe outro
lugar que nos aceite.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1443</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ミリッツァ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Militsa, eu...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1511</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……私は自分が何者なのかを
知るため……ハーフの事を
調べてるの……
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Estou numa jornada para
descobrir quem eu sou... E o que
significa ser Half...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1542</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あんたは、故郷の事や
両親の事……何か知らない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Você sabe alguma coisa sobre onde
nasceu ou quem são seus pais?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひとつだけ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A única coisa que sei é...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>where is HERE.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1609</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私はここに捨てられていた……
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Foi aqui que fui abandonada...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>"I was abandoned here."</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1786</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s0-3</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>725</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この砂漠、本当に暑いね……
日射病や熱射病対策には水だよ。
こまめに水分補給しないとね。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Esse deserto é quente demais,
hein. É bom tomar cuidado
pra não pegar insolação.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>747</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私なんて、一日に何リットルも
水を飲む事があるくらいだよ。
水は大事だよ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eu viro vários cantis por dia.
Tem que ficar hidratado!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s2-0</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4518</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;休憩しますか？
　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;Quer descansar?
Sim
Não</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
